<title>SPAIN: ATHLETICS-MARATHON MAN GOMEZ TO MISS OUT ON ATHENS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-MARATHON MAN GOMEZ TO MISS OUT ON ATHENS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish marathon runner Alejandro Gomez will miss next month's world championships due to injury, the Spanish athletics federation said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Gomez clocked a Spanish marathon best of two hours seven minutes 54 seconds when finishing runner up in the Rotterdam Marathon in April.</p>
<p>He currently lies second in this year's world rankings.</p>
</text>
